render_logs/

# Context Librarian bundles are disposable navigation artifacts.
docs/context_librarian/generated/*.md

# Local, access-restricted retention of raw evidence + alias mapping for
# redacted operational evidence in committed docs (PR #477 security review).
# Never commit this — see the redaction notes in
# docs/architecture/f52-unified-approval-runtime/rollout/SINGLE_SPEAKER_APPROVAL_UX_PRODUCTION_VERIFICATION_PLAN.md
# and BUG_AUDIT_LOG.md's BUG-148/BUG-150 entries.
**/.evidence/

# Isolated git worktrees created by Agent tool calls with isolation:"worktree"
# (e.g. background subagent runs) — transient local checkouts, never repo content.
.claude/worktrees/
